# --- shell fields ---------------------------------------------------------
# name         label used in notifications (defaults to the id)
# match        pgrep/pkill argument list that identifies the shell (required)
# also_match   extra pgrep/pkill args for helper processes that must die too
# launch       argv used to start the shell (required)
# stop         optional graceful shutdown command, run before signals
# env          optional KEY=VALUE array exported before launch
# warmup       seconds to let the incoming shell animate (default 0.35)
# timeout      seconds to wait for it to appear (default SPAWN_TIMEOUT)
# binds        suffix of the binds file to activate (binds-<x>.conf)
# adapter      executable that handles shellctl's UI commands
# wallpaper    executable provider with `get` and `set PATH`

# --- hooks ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional executables in ~/.config/shell-toggle/:
#   prep-<id>    runs right before that shell is reaped
#   post-switch  runs after a successful switch (good place for
#                `hyprctl reload`, `mango reload_config`, etc.)
